Dear lavaan group,

My question relates to lavTestLRT() with method="satorra.bentler.2010". I thought that with this method, the test statistic would always be non-negative. I also thought the test statistic was the value shown in the "Chisq diff" column in the output, but I could be wrong about that.

However, I get the following:

## Scaled Chi Square Difference Test (method = "satorra.bentler.2010")
