Subject: Re: negative variance with the "measurementInvariance" comand in lavaan - Where?
Message-ID: <l5aUQfvcZT4.S_uGCAhICAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <l5aUQfvcZT4.E-0_811xBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
