Subject: Re: Aggregate cfa.mi results with anova() - fit.indices
Message-ID: <WM2Ynmatsmk.q8wTom5MAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <WM2Ynmatsmk.q_5S9PXgAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
