Date: Tue, 27 Jun 2017 14:08:46 +0000
Subject: Re: the interpretation of the model fit indices
Message-ID: <T3wbYWIujtI.Zh4QaS4gBAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <T3wbYWIujtI.A8buyelZAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
